A colon line without a term continues no entry

```
- a
  : 

  : %%%
%%%
c
.
<ul>
  <li><p>a
:</p>
    <p>:</p>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  : x

  : %%%
%%%
c
.
<ul>
  <li><p>a
: x</p>
    <p>:</p>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  :: t
    deep
  : d

  : %%%
%%%
c
.
<ul>
  <li><p>a</p>
    <dl>
      <dt>t</dt>
    </dl>
    <p>deep
: d</p>
    <p>:</p>
  </li>
</ul>
```
